   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "A mechanic’s garage purchased 8 brake pads and 5 headlight sets for inventory and paid $1,460. Later, the mechanic purchased another order of 6 of the same brake pads and 5 of the same headlight sets and paid $1,220. How much does each part cost?",
